      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そっか……。\r\nそれでソゼ皇帝は\r\nジェイクの母さんの看病を……。",
        "official_en": "I see... Seems to me like he had your Mom on his mind when he said that.",
        "real_en": "I see... So that was why Emperor Sozhe was taking care of your mother..."
      },
