      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "母さんを看取ったソゼ皇帝が\r\n俺に残していった言葉だ。",
        "official_en": "Emperor Sozhe left me with those words after he took care of Mom.",
        "real_en": "Those were the words Emperor Sozhe left me after he was with Mom through her final moments."
